   - It also shows the running time of the algorithms.
   - This section is a concrete example of the fair set cover in action and demonstrates the effectiveness of the proposed methods.

 Section 3: "Fair Survey Collection"
   - This section describes the application of the fair set cover to two real datasets (Adult and COMPAS).
