   > *"This study investigates the impact of climate change on coastal erosion rates using satellite data from 2010–2023. Unlike previous work (Smith et al., 2:2020), which focused on land-based erosion, our approach integrates real-time oceanographic measurements. The results show a 30% increase in erosion rates in the North Sea, a finding not observed in earlier studies."*  

   This paragraph has:  
   - **Prior work references**:  
